  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You must allow your allies to join in making the world know fear. You can spend your action to expend two link depth from the link of a linked ally to empower their next successful attack roll. On a successful attack, all creatures within 15 feet of the target must pass a wisdom save or become frightened. This effect ends if your link breaks.</p><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source: Empath by Axis, co-authored by Ghostwheel</a> (CC BY-SA 3.0). See the module's AUTOMATION.md for what is automated and how rules are interpreted.</p>",
